out hero "\n\rYou dodge the pet dragon's attack.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon has some small wounds and bruises. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's pound mauls you.\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rAn old scroll crackles and burns!\n\rA pink potion bubbles and boils!\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rSome sparkling dust overloads and explodes!\n\rThe pet dragon has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou dodge the pet dragon's attack.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou block the pet dragon's attack with your shield.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon turns blue and shivers.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou parry the pet dragon's attack.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon is blinded by smoke!\n\rA small wand sparks and sputters!\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon turns blue and shivers.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's pound misses you.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's pound misses you.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou dodge the pet dragon's attack.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou parry the pet dragon's attack.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rThe pet dragon is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou block the pet dragon's attack with your shield.\n\rYour slice scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe pet dragon hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
